@startuml Grade_Submission
title Activity Diagram - Grade Submission (Score + Feedback)

|Instructor|
start
:Select a project;
:View milestone submissions;
:Select a submission to grade;
:Enter grade details:\n- Score (0-100)\n- Feedback (optional)\n- Weight Ratio Snapshot;
:Click "Submit Grade";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send grading data\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Validate request body;
:Call MilestoneGradingService.\nGradeMilestoneAsync(request);
:Get milestone by milestoneDefId;
if (Milestone not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found\n"Milestone not found";
  stop
endif

:Check if evaluation\nalready exists\n(projectId, milestoneDefId, instructorId);
if (Evaluation exists?) then (yes)
  :Update existing evaluation:\n- WeightRatioSnapshot\n- Score\n- Feedback\n- EvaluatedAt;
else (no)
  :Create new MilestoneEvaluation:\n- ProjectId\n- MilestoneDefId\n- InstructorId\n- WeightRatioSnapshot\n- Score\n- Feedback\n- EvaluatedAt;
endif

:Save changes to database;
:Return MilestoneGradeResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh grades list;
  :Send notification to student group;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View submitted grade;
stop
@enduml

